WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,640
How many powerful and wealthy people out there now only have waste paper in their hands?

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:06,090
No one is as prepared as I am

3
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:08,190
Xu Hao’s father’s family background is behind him

4
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:13,170
After half a month, I still can’t hold on.

5
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:15,170
If it hadn't been for this heavy snow that trapped everyone

6
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,540
I want to take a look at him

7
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,240
Back then, you just had to restrain yourself and get along with him better.

8
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:23,670
Now we can live in a warm house without worrying about food and drink

9
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:26,270
He just saved some supplies for an ordinary house.

10
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:28,470
My target was originally a really nice wife

11
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:31,070
Snow disaster across the country is being steadily dealt with

12
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:32,870
Residents please have firm confidence

13
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,070
support each other

14
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,170
The disaster will be alleviated soon

15
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,800
The snow doesn't show any sign of stopping.

16
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,600
The stock at home is getting less and less

17
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,400
The things to keep warm are almost gone.
